  "title": "Chef John's Pavlova with Strawberries",
  "description": "This recipe for Pavlova produces a light-tasting meringue dessert that's sweet, gooey, and crunchy. It tastes great with whipped cream and strawberries.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
